  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is to establish the Institute for land administration at the Bahir Dar University, Amhara Region. Sweden is supporting the Amahara region also through land certification and technical assistance to the EPLAUA (land administration authority).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">programmet st&#xf6;djer etableringen av en lantm&#xe4;terifakultet p&#xe5; Bahir Dar universitetet i Amhara-regionen. Sverige har sedan l&#xe4;nge st&#xf6;tt med lantm&#xe4;terifr&#xe5;gor i regionen genom certifiering och uppbyggnad av lantm&#xe4;terimyndigheten.</narrative>
